# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages. Cross-origin isolation enables SharedArrayBuffer,
# which lets the AI tools run on several CPU threads. The site works without
# these headers (single-threaded AI); see README "Deployment".
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
